        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG251, 2-1/16 Inch Round Privacy Bolt Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Round Privacy Thumbturn and Emergency Egress Set for use with a 6mm square spindle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG251-specifications.gif?v=1704442291\" width\"600\" height=\"247\" border=\"0\" atl=\"AHI SIG251 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round Privacy Thumbturn Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Coin Release Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Length: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 3/4\"\r\n<li>Trim only for 6mm square spindle.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-251-specifications.pdf?v=1691093353\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI SIG251 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
